{
    "version": "14.0.25431",
    "description": "Visual Studio Community 2015 + C++ 工作负载（VC++、MFC、ATL）。系统级安装器，非便携模式。",
    "homepage": "https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/vs/older-downloads/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Freeware",
        "url": "https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/license-terms/"
    },
    "notes": [
        "【版本锁定说明】",
        "本 manifest 已锁定到 14.0.25431，无 autoupdate、无 checkver。",
        "即使本仓库后续推送新版本 manifest（例如 vs2017-cpp 等），本 manifest 文件不会被改动，",
        "始终可以安装到 VS2015 14.0.25431。这是参照官方 versions 仓库的版本锁定模式。",
        "",
        "【安装路径】",
        "VS2015 是系统级安装器（非便携），安装目录为：",
        "  C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Visual Studio 14.0\\",
        "通过 'Developer Command Prompt for VS2015' 快捷方式加载构建环境。",
        "",
        "【URL 提示】",
        "微软可能调整 VS2015 安装包的下载链接。如果下方 URL 返回 404：",
        "  1) 从你的 Visual Studio 订阅归档页下载 VS2015 ISO，或",
        "  2) 把 vs_community.exe 镜像到你自己的 GitHub Release：",
        "       https://github.com/Cikaros/scoop-bucket/releases",
        "  3) 修改本 manifest 的 'url' 字段指向新的下载地址。",
        "",
        "【Hash 提示】",
        "本 manifest 故意省略 hash 字段。计算方法：",
        "  Get-FileHash <安装包.exe> -Algorithm SHA256",
        "或者安装时跳过校验：",
        "  scoop install cikaros/vs2015-cpp --skip"
    ],
    "url": "https://download.microsoft.com/download/0/E/B/0EB8F5E4-2BE4-4A13-A494-1FE5E9F8B5F5/vs_community_ENU.exe",
    "installer": {
        "args": [
            "/install",
            "/quiet",
            "/norestart",
            "/SelectedLanguages",
            "enu",
            "/Features",
            "VC++,MFC,ATL,NativeLanguage,Windows10SDK"
        ]
    },
    "post_install": [
        "Remove-Item -Path \"$dir\\$fname\" -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue"
    ],
    "env_set": {
        "VS140COMNTOOLS": "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Visual Studio 14.0\\Common7\\Tools\\"
    }
}
